===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|over-|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|ofer-||over-|lang=ang}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*ubar-||over-}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|over-|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|über-|lang=de}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|over-|lang=da}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|över-|lang=sv}}. More at {{l|en|over}}.

===Prefix===
{{en-prefix}}

# [[above]], or [[higher]]
# [[superior]]
# [[excessive]]ly
#: {{term|overkind}}, {{term|overloud}}
